<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>PixSwap — Pix vira USDT automaticamente</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
/* ═══ TOKENS ══════════════════════════════════════════════ */
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{
  --ink:#0B1F22;
  --ink-2:#12302F;
  --paper:#F5FAF8;
  --card:#FFFFFF;
  --teal:#0FB5A0;
  --teal-dark:#0A8A7B;
  --tether:#26A17B;
  --amber:#FFB017;
  --red:#E5484D;
  --line:#DCE8E4;
  --muted:#5E7370;
  --r-sm:10px; --r:16px; --r-lg:24px;
  --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(11,31,34,.05),0 8px 32px rgba(11,31,34,.08);
  --shadow-lg:0 2px 4px rgba(11,31,34,.06),0 24px 64px rgba(11,31,34,.14);
}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:'Instrument Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;
  background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink);
  line-height:1.5; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
h1,h2,h3,.display{font-family:'Sora',sans-serif}
.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}
.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer}
input{font-family:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:4px}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}}

/* ═══ NAV ═════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
nav{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:90;
  background:rgba(245,250,248,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:68px}
.logo{font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.25rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.logo-mark{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--teal),var(--tether));display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:800}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:500;transition:color .15s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.pill-rate{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:500;
  background:var(--ink);color:#B8F5EC;border-radius:100px;padding:8px 16px;
}
@media(max-width:760px){.nav-links a{display:none}}

/* ═══ HERO ════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.hero{padding:72px 0 40px}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 460px;gap:56px;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:980px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.eyebrow{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:500;
  letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-dark);
  background:rgba(15,181,160,.1);border:1px solid rgba(15,181,160,.25);
  border-radius:100px;padding:6px 14px;margin-bottom:22px;
}
.eyebrow .live-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);animation:blink 1.8s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.3}}
h1{
  font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.4rem);font-weight:800;
  line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-bottom:20px;
}
h1 .u-pix{color:var(--teal)}
h1 .u-usdt{color:var(--tether)}
.hero-sub{font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:460px;margin-bottom:36px}
.hero-sub strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

/* ─── PIPELINE (assinatura visual) ─── */
.pipeline{
  background:var(--ink);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:28px;
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.pipeline::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;
  background:radial-gradient(600px 200px at 20% 0%,rgba(15,181,160,.14),transparent 60%);
}
.pipe-title{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6FA39C;margin-bottom:22px}
.pipe-track{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;position:relative;z-index:1}
.pipe-node{flex-shrink:0;text-align:center;width:88px}
.pipe-icon{
  width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;margin:0 auto 10px;
  display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.3rem;
  background:#16403C;border:1px solid #22564F;
}
.pipe-node.done .pipe-icon{background:rgba(15,181,160,.2);border-color:var(--teal)}
.pipe-label{font-size:.7rem;color:#9CC4BD;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3}
.pipe-line{
  flex:1;height:2px;background:#22564F;position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-width:24px;
}
.pipe-line::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:-40%;width:40%;height:100%;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--teal),transparent);
  animation:flow 2.2s linear infinite;
}
.pipe-line:nth-of-type(4)::after{animation-delay:1.1s}
@keyframes flow{to{left:110%}}
.pipe-caption{
  margin-top:24px;font-size:.85rem;color:#9CC4BD;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.pipe-caption .mono{color:#B8F5EC;font-size:.8rem}

/* ─── stats sob o pipeline ─── */
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:36px;margin-top:32px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hstat .n{font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.hstat .l{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}

/* ═══ CONVERSOR ═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.converter{
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-lg);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);overflow:hidden;
}
.conv-tabs{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.conv-tab{
  flex:1;padding:16px;border:none;background:transparent;
  font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);
  border-bottom:3px solid transparent;transition:all .15s;
}
.conv-tab.on{color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--teal)}
.conv-tab:hover:not(.on){color:var(--ink)}
.conv-body{padding:24px}

.f-label{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}
.f-label .hint{font-weight:400;font-size:.72rem}
.f-group{margin-bottom:18px}
.amount-box{
  display:flex;align-items:stretch;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);
  overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s;background:#FBFDFC;
}
.amount-box:focus-within{border-color:var(--teal);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(15,181,160,.12)}
.cur-tag{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 16px;
  border-right:1px solid var(--line);background:#F2F7F5;min-width:104px;
}
.cur-dot{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.cur-dot.brl{background:var(--teal)}
.cur-dot.usdt{background:var(--tether)}
.cur-code{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700}
.amount-box input{
  flex:1;border:none;outline:none;background:transparent;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:500;
  padding:16px;width:100%;color:var(--ink);
}
.amount-box input::placeholder{color:#B9CCC7}

.recv-line{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  background:rgba(38,161,123,.07);border:1px solid rgba(38,161,123,.2);
  border-radius:var(--r);padding:16px;margin-bottom:18px;
}
.recv-line .rl-l{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.recv-line .rl-v{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--tether)}

/* rede */
.net-chips{display:flex;gap:10px}
.net-chip{
  flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:var(--r-sm);border:1.5px solid var(--line);
  background:#FBFDFC;font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);
  transition:all .15s;text-align:center;
}
.net-chip small{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:.68rem;margin-top:2px}
.net-chip.on{border-color:var(--teal);background:rgba(15,181,160,.08);color:var(--ink)}
.net-chip:hover:not(.on){border-color:#B9CCC7}

.text-input{
  width:100%;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);
  padding:14px 16px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.85rem;
  background:#FBFDFC;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s;color:var(--ink);
}
.text-input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--teal);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(15,181,160,.12)}
.text-input.ok{border-color:var(--tether)}
.text-input.bad{border-color:var(--red)}
.field-msg{font-size:.75rem;margin-top:6px;min-height:1em}
.field-msg.ok{color:var(--tether)}
.field-msg.bad{color:var(--red)}

.fee-box{
  border-top:1px dashed var(--line);margin-top:4px;padding-top:14px;
  font-size:.82rem;display:none;
}
.fee-box.show{display:block}
.fee-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:3px 0;color:var(--muted)}
.fee-row .fv{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:var(--ink)}
.fee-row.total{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);padding-top:8px}
.fee-row.total .fv{color:var(--tether);font-size:.95rem}

.btn-go{
  width:100%;margin-top:18px;padding:17px;border:none;border-radius:var(--r);
  background:var(--ink);color:#fff;
  font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;
  transition:all .18s;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;
}
.btn-go:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--ink-2);transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(11,31,34,.25)}
.btn-go:disabled{background:#C7D6D2;cursor:not-allowed}
.demo-note{
  margin-top:12px;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;display:none;
}
.demo-note.show{display:block}

/* ═══ SEÇÕES ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ */
section{padding:80px 0}
.sec-eyebrow{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-dark);margin-bottom:14px}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.3rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:14px}
.sec-sub{color:var(--muted);max-width:520px;font-size:1.02rem}

/* fluxo automático — a máquina */
.machine{background:var(--ink);color:#E7F5F1;border-radius:var(--r-lg);margin-top:48px;padding:8px}
.machine-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}
@media(max-width:820px){.machine-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.m-step{background:#0F2A28;border-radius:calc(var(--r-lg) - 8px);padding:28px;position:relative}
.m-step .m-tag{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.08em;
  color:var(--teal);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
}
.m-step .m-tag::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--teal)}
.m-step h3{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;color:#fff}
.m-step p{font-size:.86rem;color:#9CC4BD;line-height:1.6}
.m-step .m-time{
  margin-top:18px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--amber);
}

/* taxas */
.fee-table{
  margin-top:44px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:var(--r-lg);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.ft-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:20px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:center;gap:16px}
.ft-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.ft-row .ft-l{font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem}
.ft-row .ft-l small{display:block;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;margin-top:2px}
.ft-row .ft-v{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--teal-dark)}
.ft-row.hl{background:rgba(255,176,23,.07)}
.ft-row.hl .ft-v{color:var(--amber)}

/* FAQ */
.faq{max-width:720px;margin-top:44px}
details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
summary{
  padding:20px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:.98rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;
}
summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
summary::after{content:'+';font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--teal);flex-shrink:0;transition:transform .2s}
details[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(45deg)}
details p{padding:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;max-width:600px}

/* footer */
footer{background:var(--ink);color:#9CC4BD;padding:56px 0 36px;margin-top:40px}
.foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap:40px;padding-bottom:36px;border-bottom:1px solid #1C4640}
@media(max-width:700px){.foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.foot-grid .logo{color:#fff;margin-bottom:14px}
.foot-desc{font-size:.85rem;max-width:280px;line-height:1.65}
.foot-col h4{color:#fff;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;font-family:'Sora',sans-serif}
.foot-col a{display:block;color:#9CC4BD;font-size:.85rem;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:9px;transition:color .15s}
.foot-col a:hover{color:#fff}
.foot-bottom{padding-top:28px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;font-size:.76rem}

/* ═══ MODAL DE TRANSAÇÃO ═══════════════════════════════════ */
.overlay{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:200;display:none;
  background:rgba(11,31,34,.55);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
  align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding:6vh 20px;overflow-y:auto;
}
.overlay.open{display:flex}
.modal{
  background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--r-lg);max-width:480px;width:100%;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);animation:pop .3s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.6,1);position:relative;
  margin-bottom:6vh;
}
@keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px) scale(.98)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.modal-head{padding:24px 28px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start}
.modal-head h3{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.modal-head .m-sub{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.x-btn{
  border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper);width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;
  display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;flex-shrink:0;transition:all .15s;
}
.x-btn:hover{color:var(--ink);border-color:#B9CCC7}
.modal-body{padding:22px 28px 28px}

/* status pipeline dentro do modal */
.tx-pipe{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;margin:8px 0 20px}
.tp-step{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;position:relative;padding-bottom:22px}
.tp-step:last-child{padding-bottom:0}
.tp-step::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:15px;top:34px;bottom:0;width:2px;background:var(--line);
}
.tp-step:last-child::before{display:none}
.tp-step.done::before{background:var(--tether)}
.tp-dot{
  width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;display:grid;place-items:center;
  background:var(--paper);border:2px solid var(--line);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);
  position:relative;z-index:1;font-weight:700;
}
.tp-step.done .tp-dot{background:var(--tether);border-color:var(--tether);color:#fff}
.tp-step.active .tp-dot{border-color:var(--amber);color:var(--amber);animation:pulse-ring 1.5s ease-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse-ring{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,176,23,.4)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 10px rgba(255,176,23,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,176,23,0)}}
.tp-info .tp-t{font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem}
.tp-info .tp-d{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}

/* qr */
.qr-holder{
  background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);
  padding:18px;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:16px;min-height:216px;
}
.qr-holder img,.qr-holder canvas{border-radius:6px;max-width:180px}
.amt-banner{
  text-align:center;background:var(--paper);border-radius:var(--r);padding:18px;margin-bottom:16px;
}
.amt-banner .ab-l{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.amt-banner .ab-v{font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.9rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:4px}
.amt-banner .ab-s{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.copy-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px}
.copy-row input{
  flex:1;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:11px 14px;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);
  background:var(--paper);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;
}
.btn-copy{
  border:none;border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:11px 18px;
  background:rgba(15,181,160,.12);color:var(--teal-dark);font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;
  transition:background .15s;white-space:nowrap;
}
.btn-copy:hover{background:rgba(15,181,160,.2)}
.warn-box{
  background:rgba(255,176,23,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,176,23,.35);
  border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:12px 14px;font-size:.78rem;color:#8A6200;margin-bottom:14px;
}
.timer-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
.timer-bar{height:4px;background:var(--line);border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:18px}
.timer-bar .tb-fill{height:100%;background:var(--teal);border-radius:2px;transition:width 1s linear}

/* sucesso */
.done-box{text-align:center;padding:8px 0}
.done-ic{
  width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto 18px;
  background:rgba(38,161,123,.12);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:2rem;
  animation:pop .4s cubic-bezier(.3,1.6,.6,1);
}
.done-box h3{font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px}
.done-box .d-sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
.hash-box{
  background:var(--paper);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:12px 14px;margin:18px 0;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted);
  word-break:break-all;text-align:left;
}
.hash-box a{color:var(--teal-dark);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
.hash-box a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

/* toast */
.toast{
  position:fixed;bottom:24px;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,80px);z-index:300;
  background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px 22px;
  font-size:.88rem;font-weight:500;opacity:0;transition:all .3s cubic-bezier(.3,1.3,.6,1);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);max-width:90vw;
}
.toast.show{transform:translate(-50%,0);opacity:1}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══ NAV ═══ -->
<nav>
  <div class="wrap nav-in">
    <a class="logo" href="#">
      <span class="logo-mark">⇄</span> PixSwap
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#automatico">Como funciona</a>
      <a href="#taxas">Taxas</a>
      <a href="#faq">Dúvidas</a>
      <span class="pill-rate" id="navRate">1 USDT = R$ —</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> Conversão automática · 24 h</span>
      <h1>Seu <span class="u-pix">Pix</span> vira <span class="u-usdt">USDT</span> sem você fazer nada.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Pague um Pix e receba USDT direto na sua carteira em <strong>menos de 2 minutos</strong>. Ou envie USDT e receba um Pix. Todo o processo é automático — sem cadastro, sem espera, sem intermediário humano.</p>

      <!-- assinatura: pipeline animado -->
      <div class="pipeline" role="img" aria-label="Fluxo automático: Pix recebido, conversão na exchange, USDT enviado à carteira">
        <div class="pipe-title">O que acontece quando você paga</div>
        <div class="pipe-track">
          <div class="pipe-node done">
            <div class="pipe-icon">💠</div>
            <div class="pipe-label">Pix<br>recebido</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipe-line"></div>
          <div class="pipe-node done">
            <div class="pipe-icon">⚙️</div>
            <div class="pipe-label">Convertido<br>na exchange</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipe-line"></div>
          <div class="pipe-node done">
            <div class="pipe-icon">🛰️</div>
            <div class="pipe-label">USDT na<br>sua carteira</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pipe-caption">
          <span>Tempo médio ponta a ponta:</span>
          <span class="mono">~110 segundos</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="hstat"><div class="n" id="statRate">R$ —</div><div class="l">USDT/BRL agora</div></div>
        <div class="hstat"><div class="n">1%</div><div class="l">taxa única, sem surpresa</div></div>
        <div class="hstat"><div class="n">2 redes</div><div class="l">TRC-20 e ERC-20</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ═══ CONVERSOR ═══ -->
    <div class="converter" id="conversor">
      <div class="conv-tabs" role="tablist">
        <button class="conv-tab on" id="tabP2U" role="tab" aria-selected="true" onclick="setDir('pix2usdt')">Pix → USDT</button>
        <button class="conv-tab" id="tabU2P" role="tab" aria-selected="false" onclick="setDir('usdt2pix')">USDT → Pix</button>
      </div>
      <div class="conv-body">

        <div class="f-group">
          <div class="f-label"><span id="lblSend">Você paga</span><span class="hint" id="lblMin">mínimo R$ 20</span></div>
          <div class="amount-box">
            <div class="cur-tag">
              <span class="cur-dot brl" id="dotFrom">R$</span>
              <span class="cur-code" id="codeFrom">BRL</span>
            </div>
            <input id="inAmount" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0,00" min="0" oninput="quote()" aria-label="Valor a converter" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="recv-line">
          <span class="rl-l" id="lblRecv">Você recebe (USDT)</span>
          <span class="rl-v" id="outAmount">0.0000</span>
        </div>

        <div class="f-group">
          <div class="f-label"><span>Rede do USDT</span></div>
          <div class="net-chips" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Rede blockchain">
            <button class="net-chip on" id="chipTrc" role="radio" aria-checked="true" onclick="setNet('trc20')">TRC-20 <small>Tron · taxa mínima</small></button>
            <button class="net-chip" id="chipErc" role="radio" aria-checked="false" onclick="setNet('erc20')">ERC-20 <small>Ethereum</small></button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="f-group">
          <div class="f-label"><span id="lblDest">Sua carteira USDT</span></div>
          <input class="text-input" id="inDest" type="text" placeholder="T..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" oninput="validateDest()" aria-describedby="destMsg" />
          <div class="field-msg" id="destMsg"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="fee-box" id="feeBox">
          <div class="fee-row"><span>Cotação usada</span><span class="fv" id="fRate">—</span></div>
          <div class="fee-row"><span>Taxa PixSwap (1%)</span><span class="fv" id="fFee">—</span></div>
          <div class="fee-row"><span>Tempo estimado</span><span class="fv">~2 min</span></div>
          <div class="fee-row total"><span>Chega na sua mão</span><span class="fv" id="fTotal">—</span></div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn-go" id="btnGo" onclick="startSwap()" disabled>
          Gerar QR Code Pix
        </button>
        <div class="demo-note" id="demoNote">⚡ Servidor offline — mostrando demonstração do fluxo</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ═══ A MÁQUINA AUTOMÁTICA ═══ -->
<section id="automatico">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Zero intervenção humana</div>
    <h2>Uma máquina que trabalha sozinha</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">Do momento em que seu banco confirma o Pix até o USDT chegar na sua carteira, nenhuma pessoa toca na transação. Três sistemas conversam entre si:</p>

    <div class="machine">
      <div class="machine-grid">
        <div class="m-step">
          <div class="m-tag">Etapa 1 · Gateway Pix</div>
          <h3>Seu banco confirma, nós ouvimos</h3>
          <p>O gateway de pagamento nos avisa por webhook assinado no exato instante em que o Pix é liquidado pelo Banco Central. A verificação criptográfica impede fraude.</p>
          <div class="m-time">⏱ 0 a 10 segundos</div>
        </div>
        <div class="m-step">
          <div class="m-tag">Etapa 2 · Exchange</div>
          <h3>Compra na cotação real</h3>
          <p>Uma ordem de mercado é executada na Binance na hora, sem spread escondido. Você recebe exatamente a quantidade comprada, menos a taxa única de 1%.</p>
          <div class="m-time">⏱ 1 a 3 segundos</div>
        </div>
        <div class="m-step">
          <div class="m-tag">Etapa 3 · Blockchain</div>
          <h3>USDT sai para sua carteira</h3>
          <p>A transferência on-chain é assinada e transmitida automaticamente na rede que você escolheu. Você recebe o hash para acompanhar no explorador.</p>
          <div class="m-time">⏱ 30 a 90 segundos</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ TAXAS ═══ -->
<section id="taxas" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Sem letra miúda</div>
    <h2>O preço que você vê é o que você paga</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">A cotação vem direto da Binance, sem margem embutida. Nossa única cobrança é a taxa de serviço.</p>

    <div class="fee-table">
      <div class="ft-row hl">
        <div class="ft-l">Taxa de conversão <small>Único custo do serviço, já mostrado no cálculo antes de você confirmar</small></div>
        <div class="ft-v">1%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ft-row">
        <div class="ft-l">Spread na cotação <small>Usamos o preço de mercado da Binance em tempo real</small></div>
        <div class="ft-v">R$ 0</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ft-row">
        <div class="ft-l">Taxa de rede TRC-20 <small>Absorvida por nós — você recebe o valor cheio</small></div>
        <div class="ft-v">R$ 0</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ft-row">
        <div class="ft-l">Valor mínimo <small>Por conversão, em qualquer direção</small></div>
        <div class="ft-v">R$ 20</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ft-row">
        <div class="ft-l">Limite sem verificação <small>Acima disso, pedimos documentos conforme regras do COAF</small></div>
        <div class="ft-v">R$ 10.000</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ FAQ ═══ -->
<section id="faq" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Perguntas frequentes</div>
    <h2>Dúvidas comuns</h2>

    <div class="faq">
      <details>
        <summary>Preciso criar conta ou enviar documentos?</summary>
        <p>Não, para valores até R$ 10.000 por transação. Você só informa a carteira de destino (ou chave Pix, no sentido inverso). Acima do limite, a legislação brasileira exige verificação de identidade.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Quanto tempo demora de verdade?</summary>
        <p>O tempo médio ponta a ponta é de 2 minutos. A parte mais lenta é a confirmação na blockchain: TRC-20 leva 30 a 60 segundos; ERC-20 pode levar alguns minutos dependendo do congestionamento da rede Ethereum.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>E se eu pagar o Pix e algo der errado?</summary>
        <p>Cada transação tem um identificador único rastreável. Se a conversão falhar por qualquer motivo após o pagamento, o valor é estornado para a mesma conta que enviou o Pix. Nada fica retido.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Qual a diferença entre TRC-20 e ERC-20?</summary>
        <p>São redes diferentes que transportam o mesmo USDT. TRC-20 (rede Tron) é mais rápida e tem taxa quase zero — recomendada para a maioria. ERC-20 (rede Ethereum) é aceita em mais serviços, mas as taxas de rede são maiores. Confirme qual rede sua carteira ou exchange aceita antes de escolher.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Vocês seguram meu dinheiro em algum momento?</summary>
        <p>Não operamos como custódia. O fluxo é atômico: Pix confirmado → compra na exchange → envio imediato para sua carteira. Não existe saldo parado em conta na plataforma.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Como funciona o sentido USDT → Pix?</summary>
        <p>Você informa sua chave Pix, envia USDT para o endereço único gerado para sua transação e, assim que a rede confirma o depósito, vendemos o USDT e disparamos o Pix para sua chave — tudo automático, no mesmo padrão do fluxo de ida.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

